(http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aymara_language#Unique_features), I came
across this thing called 'ternary logic'
(http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ternary_logic). Could some logji selsau
ja certu comment on this peculiar (to me) multi-valued logic system
from a Lojbanist viewpoint? (Can Lojban express ternary logic?)

